# --- Analysis outputs are manuscript evidence and MUST be tracked ---
# The patterns above (*.png, *.fgr2, *.jac, *.cos, *.newick, *.hist) are aimed at
# stray working files in the repo root. The analysis/ tree is the reproducibility
# record backing the manuscript, so its scripts, figures and raw results are
# re-included here. Note these are scoped re-includes rather than a blanket
# `!analysis/**`, which would also resurrect __pycache__ and other build noise.
!analysis/
!analysis/scripts/
!analysis/scripts/*.py
!analysis/scripts/*.sh
!analysis/figures/
!analysis/figures/*.png
!analysis/results/
!analysis/results/*.json
!analysis/results/*.txt

# ...but never build noise, even under analysis/
analysis/**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

